null},{"k":"20:7","t":"And if you speak aloud - then indeed, He knows the secret and what is [even] more hidden.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"20:8","t":"Allāh - there is no deity except Him. To Him belong the best names.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"20:9","t":"And has the story of Moses reached you? -","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"20:10","t":"When he saw a fire and said to his family, \"Stay here; indeed, I have perceived a fire; perhaps I can bring you a torch or find at the fire some guidance.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"20:11","t":"And when he came to it, he was called, \"O Moses,","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"20:12","t":"Indeed, I am your Lord, so remove your sandals. Indeed, you are in the blessed valley of Ṭuwā.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":12,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19,20],"sajdah":false}